#: scripts/shiptemplates/corvette.lua:306
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Jump Carrier"
msgstr "Jump Carrier"

#: scripts/shiptemplates/corvette.lua:307
msgid ""
"The Jump Carrier is a specialized Freighter. It does not carry any cargo, as "
"it's cargo bay is taken up by a specialized jump drive and the energy "
"storage required to run this jump drive.\n"
"It is designed to carry other ships deep into space. So it has special "
"docking parameters, allowing other ships to attach themselves to this ship."
msgstr "The Jump Carrier is a specialised Freighter. It does not carry any cargo, as it's cargo bay is taken up by a specialised jump drive and the energy storage required to run this jump drive.\nIt is designed to carry other ships deep into space. So it has special docking parameters, allowing other ships to attach themselves to this ship."

